5,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,We need to know if our past projects actually worked for the people using them.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I am concerned about how long these projects take and how the rooms are used later.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,The schedules keep slipping. I want to see why the calendar is so unreliable lately.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Kenji,,The costs on paper never match reality. I need to see where the money actually goes.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,The same few staff are doing all the work. I want to check their workload.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Benjamin, if the schedule slips, does that affect the final quality of the space?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Mizuki, yes, but I am more worried about the hidden time costs during construction.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Victoria, the delays are often due to things nobody priced for initially.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Shunichi, if the staff are overworked, does that affect the maintenance costs later?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Kenji, it definitely does. The routine upkeep is falling on fewer and fewer people.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,I will look into the post-occupancy reviews to see what users actually think.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Victoria,,I will check the timetable records to see how long rooms are out of service.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I will review the tender records to see if costs are rising unexpectedly.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I will look at the renewal reserve to see if we are funding replacements properly.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I will check the staffing posts to see who is carrying the extra load.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,"It is important to hear from the users, not just the builders.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Victoria,,The downtime is a huge hidden cost that we often ignore.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"If the bids are rising, we need to know why before we commit.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Kenji,,"If we don't save for replacements, we are just deferring the problem.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,We cannot keep asking the same people to do more without support.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
