72,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,I also support Candidate A. It avoids the rising mechanical costs.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Kenji,,I vote for Candidate A. It solves the renewal reserve problem.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,I am with you. Candidate A is the most sustainable option for our staff.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Mizuki,,Let's go with Candidate A. It seems to be the best fit for all our concerns.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Victoria,,Agreed. It is the most logical choice based on the data we have.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Benjamin,,I concur. It is the most cost-effective and efficient option.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Kenji,,I am happy to support it. It addresses the financial gaps we identified.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Shunichi,,I am confident in this choice. It is the best for the team and the campus.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
